spoiler":false,"text":"The Little Devil Childhood Friend"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I'll make you fall in love with me for sure!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Otonashi Sumiya's childhood friend, she has had a crush on him since she was young. Impulsive and not very smart, sometimes when she gets too positive, she makes mistake as well, but she properly reflects and tries hard to make up for it, a troublemaker who is difficult to hate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She likes to tease others, and is fine with being teased if it is done by someone she likes. She also likes to look up and practice seduction techniques from the Internet."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c132865"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5803b8d52317689b8a9079be17ae3ddd6d3f7dd7c6dbfdd434bdaf5fd3e86f0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c72653fadb0cebbdf189224155bc74d92f2a98c2aabfca382ca5cddb9b90342e.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夏和小","creatorId":"vndb:s8737","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8737","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8737","name":"藤田 茜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:100305","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c151789","characterName":"悠希 七菜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c151789"},"originalCharacterName":"悠希 七菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nana is a meticulous and reliable honor student who serves as the class representative. She is good at both sport and study, and has a sharp mind; from the outside she seems like a perfect superhuman girl. However, because she is so serious, she can unconsciously become harsh when she sees sloppy or lazy people, which makes it hard for her to fit in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On the other hand, when she puts on a maid uniform, her personality changes completely! She is transformed into a super adorable girl who is bubbly and affectionate. The transformation is so complete that she has become the overwhelmingly popular poster girl at the maid cafe where she secretly works as a part-timer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She says she is under a \"maid curse,\" but even she herself doesn't really know what that curse is."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c151789"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e66755cbee15b66a6df4907084a4f38b8f18a7d78fceb0e9ff44559c9b51fa57.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c8aa782a64833f567e557679029a96122a37a734e4445305830421b419667ea6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高野 零","creatorId":"vndb:s43655","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s43655","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s43655","name":"三浦 千幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:100306","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c153793","characterName":"守山 優陽","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c153793"},"originalCharacterName":"守山 優陽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e1f540e106d4ebb0612682fd350a944771361829658acf39641